<div class="about-wrap">
  <div class="about-eyebrow">About</div>
  <h1>About Scrolly SEO</h1>
  <p class="about-lede">Scrolly SEO helps small businesses get found by the customers already searching for what they sell &mdash; starting with a clear, evidence-based picture of where they stand today.</p>

  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <p>We build two kinds of tools:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>A <a href="https://scrollyseo.com/">Personalized SEO Site Audit</a> &mdash; a 29-section, evidence-based analysis of your site's search visibility, technical performance, and growth opportunities, delivered within 2 business days.</li>
    <li>Guided workbooks &mdash; the <a href="https://scrollyseo.com/shopify-seo-workbook/">Shopify SEO Workbook</a> and the <a href="https://scrollyseo.com/pinterest-seo-workbook/">Pinterest SEO Workbook</a> &mdash; for business owners who'd rather do the research and strategy work themselves.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we work</h2>
  <p>Every finding we hand you is labeled by exactly how it was produced, so you always know what's fact and what's judgment:</p>
  <div class="method-list">
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Observed</strong> &mdash; we analyzed it directly.</li>
      <li><strong>Retrieved</strong> &mdash; pulled from real data sources.</li>
      <li><strong>Calculated</strong> &mdash; calculated from retrieved data.</li>
      <li><strong>Inference</strong> &mdash; our analysis, clearly labeled as judgment.</li>
      <li><strong>Pending</strong> &mdash; not yet verified, and clearly marked as such.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <p>We don't invent metrics or dress up guesses as data. If something can't be verified, we say so.</p>

  <h2>Get in touch</h2>
  <p>Questions before you buy? <a href="https://scrollyseo.com/contact/">Contact us</a> or check the <a href="https://scrollyseo.com/#faq">FAQ</a>.</p>
</div>
